    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a12379674cb8a1a0",
      "translationZh": "类型检查器工作规则：AGENTS.md、问责规则和已保存的状态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4701c64d7d008373",
      "translationZh": "项目如何起步：docs/history.md",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cd475cbe31736bb",
      "translationZh": "推送一个 v<version> 标签（例如 v0.1.0）。发布工作流会构建、打包并测试这些包，将它们发布到 npm，并创建一个 GitHub 发布版本。稳定版本会被分配到 dist-tag latest，预发布版本（v0.2.0-beta.1）则会被分配到 next，并创建一个 GitHub 预发布版本。参见 npm/README.md。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
